@CleanArchitectureTemplate.API_HostAddress = https://localhost:50658

### Request an email verification code
POST {{CleanArchitectureTemplate.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/send-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "developer@example.com"
}

### Register (replace the sample code with the one received by email)
POST {{CleanArchitectureTemplate.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Developer User",
  "email": "developer@example.com",
  "password": "Password1",
  "confirmPassword": "Password1",
  "otpCode": "123456"
}

### Log in
POST {{CleanArchitectureTemplate.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "developer@example.com",
  "password": "Password1"
}

### List products with filtering, search, sorting, and pagination
GET {{CleanArchitectureTemplate.API_HostAddress}}/api/products?search=phone&minPrice=10&maxPrice=500&inStockOnly=true&sortBy=price%20desc&pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Create a product (replace the token)
POST {{CleanArchitectureTemplate.API_HostAddress}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer paste-access-token-here
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Example product",
  "price": 49.99,
  "stock": 10
}

###
